@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@tokenA = 替换为房主用户 token
@tokenB = 替换为玩家B用户 token
@roomCode = 替换为练习房 roomCode
@handId = 替换为手牌 id

### get current server-authoritative game state
GET {{baseUrl}}/practice/rooms/{{roomCode}}/game-state
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### start first hand
POST {{baseUrl}}/practice/rooms/{{roomCode}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### player action: call
POST {{baseUrl}}/practice/rooms/{{roomCode}}/actions
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actionType": "CALL"
}

### player action: check
POST {{baseUrl}}/practice/rooms/{{roomCode}}/actions
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actionType": "CHECK"
}

### player action: bet
POST {{baseUrl}}/practice/rooms/{{roomCode}}/actions
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actionType": "BET",
  "amount": 50
}

### player action: raise to amount
POST {{baseUrl}}/practice/rooms/{{roomCode}}/actions
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actionType": "RAISE",
  "amount": 150
}

### player action: all-in
POST {{baseUrl}}/practice/rooms/{{roomCode}}/actions
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actionType": "ALL_IN"
}

### start next hand after HAND_FINISHED
POST {{baseUrl}}/practice/rooms/{{roomCode}}/next-hand
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### end room normally
POST {{baseUrl}}/practice/rooms/{{roomCode}}/end
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### list room hand records
GET {{baseUrl}}/practice/rooms/{{roomCode}}/hands
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### get latest hand replay
GET {{baseUrl}}/practice/rooms/{{roomCode}}/latest-hand-replay
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### get room stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/practice/rooms/{{roomCode}}/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### get raw hand record
GET {{baseUrl}}/practice/hands/{{handId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### get sanitized hand replay
GET {{baseUrl}}/practice/hands/{{handId}}/replay
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### admin list practice hands
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/practice-hands
Authorization: Bearer 替换为管理员 token
